<section xml:lang="en-US" xml:id="picture-lab" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Picture Lab for 2D Arrays</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>
      The <url
      href="https://secure-media.collegeboard.org/digitalServices/pdf/ap/picture-lab-studentguide.pdf"
      visual="https://secure-media.collegeboard.org/digitalServices/pdf/ap/picture-lab-studentguide.pdf">Picture
      Lab</url> is a fun lab that you may have started in an earlier challenge
      and can finish in the next pages.
    </p>

    <p>
      There is also a new College Board called the <url
      href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pa5-KLRRE-5awoqnbPQd1yhqCaoPv_n4/view?usp=sharing">
      SteganographyLab</url> that continues on from the Picture Lab and explores hiding
      messages in images.
    </p>
  </introduction>
</section>
